{'symbol': 'TFX', 'date': '2023-05-08 06:30:00', 'title': 'TELEFLEX ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "WAYNE, PA., MAY 08, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TELEFLEX INCORPORATED (NYSE: TFX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF THIRTY-FOUR CENTS ($0.34) PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JUNE 15, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 15, 2023.\xa0\xa0 ADDITIONAL INFORMATION ABOUT TELEFLEX CAN BE OBTAINED FROM THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE AT TELEFLEX.COM ."}